results.description:
Nigerian officials confirm foreign jihadists behind seizure of dozens of Christian villages in Plateau State according to local youth leaders. 

Recovery is underway thanks to U.S.-Nigeria counterterrorism partnership, per human rights lawyer Solomon Dalyop.

@USinNigeria @USAfricaCommand

